---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="MathMyRate | Price your independent work" description="Practical, transparent rate planning for independent work.">
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-20 pt-20 md:px-8 md:pb-28 md:pt-28">
      <p class="eyebrow page-enter">The independent work desk</p>
      <div class="mt-6 max-w-4xl page-enter" style="animation-delay:.08s">
        <h1 class="display text-5xl font-bold leading-[.93] md:text-7xl">Price work that<br />can carry your life.</h1>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Clear planning tools for freelancers who want their quote to account for real capacity, expenses, and a tax reserve.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3 page-enter" style="animation-delay:.16s">
        <a href="/freelance/hourly-rate-calculator/" class="rounded-full bg-moss px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-paper hover:bg-ink">Find my hourly rate</a>
        <a href="/freelance/project-rate-calculator/" class="rounded-full border border-ink/25 px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-mist">Quote a project</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="border-y border-line bg-mist/60"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-px md:grid-cols-3">
      <a class="bg-paper p-8 transition-colors hover:bg-[#edf2e9] md:p-12" href="/freelance/hourly-rate-calculator/"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Capacity</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl font-bold">Freelance hourly<br />&amp; day rate</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-ink/65">Turn an annual take-home target into a practical floor rate.</p><span class="mt-8 block font-semibold text-moss">Open calculator →</span></a>
      <a class="bg-paper p-8 transition-colors hover:bg-[#f7eee6] md:p-12" href="/freelance/project-rate-calculator/"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Scope</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl font-bold">Project rate<br />calculator</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-ink/65">Build a quote from time, contingency, and reimbursable costs.</p><span class="mt-8 block font-semibold text-clay">Open calculator →</span></a>
      <a class="bg-paper p-8 transition-colors hover:bg-[#efe9dc] md:p-12" href="/fees/stripe-fee-calculator/"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Fees</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl font-bold">Stripe fee<br />calculator</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-ink/65">See the card-processing fee and what a sale really pays you.</p><span class="mt-8 block font-semibold text-ink">Open calculator →</span></a>
    </div></section>
    <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-20 md:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] md:px-8"><p class="eyebrow">Useful, not mystical</p><div><h2 class="display text-4xl font-bold">A number with its workings attached.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Every result names the assumptions behind it. Your tax percentage is a planning reserve you choose, not tax advice. Results stay in your browser, and money is calculated in exact cents.</p></div></section>
  </main>
</Layout>